    "detailed_description": "In this 2D pixel art platformer, you play as a tiny red square, solving puzzles and fighting different types of enemies. The puzzles become increasingly difficult as you progress through the game. Each location features a different set of enemies, mechanics and music, with a boss at the end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/76340a0f98a7a9614e31b8f3d3de4685.poster.avif?t=1740993618\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/76340a0f98a7a9614e31b8f3d3de4685.webm?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/76340a0f98a7a9614e31b8f3d3de4685.mp4?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Charming single player gameplay with no need to rush.<br></li><li>A small yet beautiful world to explore.<br></li><li>Logical puzzles with different mechanics.<br></li><li>Some enemies to not make the game too easy ( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0).<br></li><li>Trampolines.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/d3f44b19c6eda352ddd4728b3fe4023d.poster.avif?t=1740993618\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/d3f44b19c6eda352ddd4728b3fe4023d.webm?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/d3f44b19c6eda352ddd4728b3fe4023d.mp4?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "In this 2D pixel art platformer, you play as a tiny red square, solving puzzles and fighting different types of enemies. The puzzles become increasingly difficult as you progress through the game. Each location features a different set of enemies, mechanics and music, with a boss at the end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/76340a0f98a7a9614e31b8f3d3de4685.poster.avif?t=1740993618\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/76340a0f98a7a9614e31b8f3d3de4685.webm?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/76340a0f98a7a9614e31b8f3d3de4685.mp4?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Charming single player gameplay with no need to rush.<br></li><li>A small yet beautiful world to explore.<br></li><li>Logical puzzles with different mechanics.<br></li><li>Some enemies to not make the game too easy ( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0).<br></li><li>Trampolines.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/d3f44b19c6eda352ddd4728b3fe4023d.poster.avif?t=1740993618\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/d3f44b19c6eda352ddd4728b3fe4023d.webm?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960090/extras/d3f44b19c6eda352ddd4728b3fe4023d.mp4?t=1740993618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
